{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-19351","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-19605","text":"The [&] Protocol Ecosystem"}]},{"id":"blk-19352","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-19606","text":"This repository holds the [&] Protocol specification and every in-tree reference implementation of it, plus the portfolio products that build on top. This document is the one-page tour for someone trying to understand how the pieces fit."}]},{"id":"blk-19353","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-19607","text":"For authoritative status — what's shipped, what's in progress, what the test counts are — see "},{"id":"spn-19608","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/STACK_COMPLETION.md"}],"text":"`STACK_COMPLETION.md`"},{"id":"spn-19609","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-19354","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-19610","text":"The stack, in one diagram"}]},{"id":"blk-19355","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"                      ┌──────────────────────────────────────┐\n                      │   [&] Protocol — composition algebra  │\n                      │    6 primitives · 2 operators        │\n                      │    (AmpersandBoxDesign/)             │\n                      └───────────────┬──────────────────────┘\n                                      │ compiles into\n                  ┌───────────────────┴────────────────────┐\n                  │                                        │\n          ┌───────┴────────┐                      ┌────────┴────────┐\n          │   MCP runtime  │                      │  A2A coordination│\n          │   transport    │                      │    transport      │\n          └───────┬────────┘                      └─────────────────┘\n                  │\n   ┌──────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────┐\n   │              │                                           │\n   │   OS protocols (OpenSentience) — 11 normative protocols  │\n   │   OS-001 Continual Learning  → Graphonomous              │\n   │   OS-002 κ-Routing           → Graphonomous              │\n   │   OS-003 Deliberation        → Graphonomous              │\n   │   OS-004 Attention           → Graphonomous              │\n   │   OS-005 Model Tier          → (system-level)            │\n   │   OS-006 Governance Shim     → delegatic                 │\n   │   OS-007 Adversarial         → (draft)                   │\n   │   OS-008 Agent Harness       → open_sentience            │\n   │   OS-009 PRISM benchmark     → PRISM                     │\n   │   OS-010 PULSE temporal      → PULSE                     │\n   │   OS-011 Embodiment          → body-browser + body-os    │\n   └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"},{"id":"blk-19356","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-19611","text":"The dark-factory closed loop"}]},{"id":"blk-19357","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-19612","text":"The north-star use case for this stack is the "},{"id":"spn-19613","marks":["bold"],"text":"dark factory"},{"id":"spn-19614","text":": agents hosted on machines that operate autonomously, learn continually, and transfer skills to each other. Seven steps close the loop:"}]},{"id":"blk-19358","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │  1. Machine A perceives & acts           ←  body-browser     │\n  │                                              body-os         │\n  │  2. Records InteractionTrace             ←  Graphonomous     │\n  │     (&memory.episodic.store)                                 │\n  │                                                              │\n  │  3. Learns via memory consolidation       ←  Graphonomous    │\n  │     (consolidation, κ-routing)                               │\n  │                                                              │\n  │  4. Crystallizes to SkillCandidate        ←  FleetPrompt     │\n  │     (Crystallizer + Oban PollWorker +                        │\n  │      GraphonomousClient.HTTP)                                │\n  │                                                              │\n  │  5. Ships via FleetPrompt                 ←  FleetPrompt     │\n  │     (Registry, Trust, InstallEngine)                         │\n  │                                                              │\n  │  6. Machine B installs + replays          ←  body-browser    │\n  │     (with fresh authorization on             body-os         │\n  │      destructive edges per OS-011 §4.4)      delegatic       │\n  │                                              (authorizer)    │\n  │                                                              │\n  │  7. PRISM measures                        ←  PRISM           │\n  │     (OS-011 scenario suite,                                  │\n  │      BYOR cross-system benchmark)                            │\n  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"},{"id":"blk-19359","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-19615","text":"Current status (see "},{"id":"spn-19616","marks":["code"],"text":"STACK_COMPLETION.md"},{"id":"spn-19617","text":" for always-live detail): "},{"id":"spn-19618","marks":["bold"],"text":"7 of 7 steps fully in-tree"},{"id":"spn-19619","text":". Every step has implemented code paths, passing tests, and (for the MCP-exposed pieces) deployment configs."}]},{"id":"blk-19360","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-19620","text":"Product map"}]},{"id":"blk-19361","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-19621","text":"Shipping products"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-19363","spans":[{"id":"spn-19622","text":"Product"}]},{"id":"blk-19364","spans":[{"id":"spn-19623","text":"Role in the loop"}]},{"id":"blk-19365","spans":[{"id":"spn-19624","text":"Transport"}]},{"id":"blk-19366","spans":[{"id":"spn-19625","text":"Test count"}]}],"id":"blk-19362","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-19367","spans":[{"id":"spn-19626","text":"Graphonomous"}]},{"id":"blk-19368","spans":[{"id":"spn-19627","text":"episodic memory + continual learning engine"}]},{"id":"blk-19369","spans":[{"id":"spn-19628","text":"MCP (stdio/HTTP)"}]},{"id":"blk-19370","spans":[{"id":"spn-19629","text":"573"}]}],[{"id":"blk-19371","spans":[{"id":"spn-19630","text":"PULSE"}]},{"id":"blk-19372","spans":[{"id":"spn-19631","text":"temporal loop manifest standard"}]},{"id":"blk-19373","spans":[{"id":"spn-19632","text":"npm package"}]},{"id":"blk-19374","spans":[{"id":"spn-19633","text":"3"}]}],[{"id":"blk-19375","spans":[{"id":"spn-19634","text":"PRISM"}]},{"id":"blk-19376","spans":[{"id":"spn-19635","text":"cross-system CL benchmark"}]},{"id":"blk-19377","spans":[{"id":"spn-19636","text":"MCP + LiveView"}]},{"id":"blk-19378","spans":[{"id":"spn-19637","text":"172"}]}],[{"id":"blk-19379","spans":[{"id":"spn-19638","text":"[&] reference"}]},{"id":"blk-19380","spans":[{"id":"spn-19639","text":"protocol spec + Elixir CLI"}]},{"id":"blk-19381","spans":[{"id":"spn-19640","text":"CLI"}]},{"id":"blk-19382","spans":[{"id":"spn-19641","text":"58"}]}],[{"id":"blk-19383","spans":[{"id":"spn-19642","text":"body-browser"}]},{"id":"blk-19384","spans":[{"id":"spn-19643","marks":["code"],"text":"&body.browser"},{"id":"spn-19644","text":" provider (OS-011)"}]},{"id":"blk-19385","spans":[{"id":"spn-19645","text":"MCP (stdio/HTTP)"}]},{"id":"blk-19386","spans":[{"id":"spn-19646","text":"41"}]}],[{"id":"blk-19387","spans":[{"id":"spn-19647","text":"body-os"}]},{"id":"blk-19388","spans":[{"id":"spn-19648","marks":["code"],"text":"&body.os"},{"id":"spn-19649","text":" provider (OS-011)"}]},{"id":"blk-19389","spans":[{"id":"spn-19650","text":"MCP (stdio/HTTP)"}]},{"id":"blk-19390","spans":[{"id":"spn-19651","text":"41"}]}],[{"id":"blk-19391","spans":[{"id":"spn-19652","marks":["bold"],"text":"delegatic"}]},{"id":"blk-19392","spans":[{"id":"spn-19653","marks":["bold"],"text":"OS-006 authorization kernel"}]},{"id":"blk-19393","spans":[{"id":"spn-19654","marks":["bold"],"text":"MCP (stdio/HTTP)"}]},{"id":"blk-19394","spans":[{"id":"spn-19655","marks":["bold"],"text":"42"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-19395","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-19656","text":"Progressing products (4)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-19397","spans":[{"id":"spn-19657","text":"Product"}]},{"id":"blk-19398","spans":[{"id":"spn-19658","text":"Role"}]},{"id":"blk-19399","spans":[{"id":"spn-19659","text":"Tests"}]}],"id":"blk-19396","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-19400","spans":[{"id":"spn-19660","text":"Agentelic"}]},{"id":"blk-19401","spans":[{"id":"spn-19661","text":"spec-driven agent builder"}]},{"id":"blk-19402","spans":[{"id":"spn-19662","text":"66"}]}],[{"id":"blk-19403","spans":[{"id":"spn-19663","text":"FleetPrompt"}]},{"id":"blk-19404","spans":[{"id":"spn-19664","text":"marketplace + trust + install + crystallizer"}]},{"id":"blk-19405","spans":[{"id":"spn-19665","text":"121 (108 + 13 install tests)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-19406","spans":[{"id":"spn-19666","text":"SpecPrompt"}]},{"id":"blk-19407","spans":[{"id":"spn-19667","text":"spec-driven dev toolchain"}]},{"id":"blk-19408","spans":[{"id":"spn-19668","text":"93"}]}],[{"id":"blk-19409","spans":[{"id":"spn-19669","text":"RuneFort"}]},{"id":"blk-19410","spans":[{"id":"spn-19670","text":"spatial cognition visualization (SvelteKit)"}]},{"id":"blk-19411","spans":[{"id":"spn-19671","text":"—"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-19412","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-19672","text":"Frontend apps (2)"}]},{"id":"blk-19413","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-19673","text":"WebHost.Systems (React dashboard, 143 tests) and BendScript (SvelteKit KAG editor, 26 tests)."}]},{"id":"blk-19414","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-19674","text":"Spec-only (5)"}]},{"id":"blk-19415","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-19675","text":"AgenTroMatic (1118-line spec), Delegatic (630), Deliberatic (418), GeoFleetic (987), TickTickClock (1013)."}]},{"id":"blk-19416","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-19676","text":"The three protocols in depth"}]},{"id":"blk-19417","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-19677","text":"All three fit together as a three-layer stack:"}]},{"id":"blk-19418","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-19420","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-19678","marks":["bold"],"text":"[&]"},{"id":"spn-19679","text":" (composition) — agents declare what capabilities they have via "},{"id":"spn-19680","marks":["code"],"text":".ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-19681","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-19419","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-19422","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-19682","marks":["bold"],"text":"PULSE"},{"id":"spn-19683","text":" (temporal) — agents declare how their capabilities circulate via "},{"id":"spn-19684","marks":["code"],"text":".pulse.json"},{"id":"spn-19685","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-19421","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-19424","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-19686","marks":["bold"],"text":"PRISM"},{"id":"spn-19687","text":" (diagnostic) — benchmarks measure the loops over time."}]}],"id":"blk-19423","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-19425","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-19688","text":"Example: Graphonomous declares its continual-learning loop in "},{"id":"spn-19689","marks":["code"],"text":"PULSE/manifests/graphonomous.continual_learning.json"},{"id":"spn-19690","text":"; PRISM reads that manifest directly to discover phases, signatures, and substrates — no separate benchmark config needed."}]},{"id":"blk-19426","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-19691","text":"Shared infrastructure"}]},{"id":"blk-19427","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-19429","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-19692","marks":["bold"],"text":"Supabase"},{"id":"spn-19693","text":": single shared instance, "},{"id":"spn-19694","marks":["code"],"text":"fleet.*"},{"id":"spn-19695","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-19696","marks":["code"],"text":"kag.*"},{"id":"spn-19697","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-19698","marks":["code"],"text":"webhost.*"},{"id":"sp